Any of you who have been posting to lojban-list lately have been inundated
with bounces referring to a machine at gatech.edu.  However, there is no
such user on lojban-list!  I finally figured out that the bounce results
from a mis-set forwarding address at arecibo.aero.org, where one of
our members is.  I have pulled his link, so the bounces should stop.

Apologies to all who have suffered from these unwanted bounce messages.

